---
description: >-
  Combines "excludes weekends" with a "weekend saturday" directive
  (redefining the weekend start day to Saturday) using the
  YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss dateFormat, exercising custom weekend-day
  exclusion together with time-of-day timestamps.
---
gantt
  dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss
  excludes    weekends
  weekend saturday
  section     Section
  A task      :a1, 2025-07-04 20:30:30, 2025-07-08 10:30:30
  Another task:after a1, 20h
